# AI-Powered Financial Fraud Detection & Real-Time Risk Analysis Platform

An AI-powered financial fraud detection platform designed to identify suspicious transactions using machine learning, statistical anomaly detection, transaction-velocity analysis, and customizable business rules. The project aims to provide risk scoring, explainable predictions, real-time transaction simulation, and cost-aware fraud prevention through an interactive dashboard.

> **Project status:** Architecture and development plan defined. Full module integration, end-to-end testing, and quantitative performance evaluation are pending unless explicitly verified in the implementation.

